		(property "Description" "The LM1815 is an adaptive sense amplifier and default gating circuit for motor control applications. The sense amplifier provides a one-shot pulse output • Ground Referenced Input whose leading edge coincides with the negative going zero crossing of a ground referenced input signal such as from a variable reluctance magnetic pick-up coil."
